characters/objects) to include in the video. Each example can either be an image set (frontal + reference images) or a video. Reference in prompt as @Element1, @Element2, etc.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-start space-y-2"><div class="select-none space-x-2"><code class="leading-2 select-text rounded bg-black/[2%] px-2 py-1 align-middle text-sm font-semibold text-content-base dark:bg-white/5">shot_type</code><span class="select-auto"> </span><code class="select-text text-sm text-content-light">ShotTypeEnum</code></div><div class="prose max-w-full ps-2 dark:prose-invert md:ps-3 lg:ps-4"><div><p>The type of multi-shot video generation. &#x27;intelligent&#x27; lets the model automatically determine shot structure. Default value: <code>&quot;customize&quot;</code></p></div><p>Possible enum values:<!-- --> <code>customize, intelligent</code></p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-start space-y-2"><div class="select-none space-x-2"><code class="leading-2 select-text rounded bg-black/[2%] px-2 py-1 align-middle text-sm font-semibold text-content-base dark:bg-white/5">negative_prompt</code><span class="select-auto"> </span><code class="select-text text-sm text-content-light">string</code></div><div class="prose max-w-full ps-2 dark:prose-invert md:ps-3 lg:ps-4"><div><p>Default value: <code>&quot;blur, distort, and low quality&quot;</code></p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-start space-y-2"><div class="select-none space-x-2"><code class="leading-2 select-text rounded bg-black/[2%] px-2 py-1 align-middle text-sm font-semibold text-content-base dark:bg-white/5">cfg_scale</code><span class="select-auto"> </span><code class="select-text text-sm text-content-light">float</code></div><div class="prose max-w-full ps-2 dark:prose-invert md:ps-3 lg:ps-4"><div><p>The CFG (Classifier Free Guidance) scale is a measure of how close you want
