age To Video\",\"description\":\"Kling V2.6 (pro) Image to Video API.\\n\\nThe Kling V2.6 model is the latest generation of image-to-video with\\nimproved visual quality and motion consistency. This version also\\nsupports native audio generation when the `generate_audio` parameter is enabled.\",\"operationId\":\"v26_pro_image_to_video_v2_6_pro_image_to_video_post\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ImageToVideoV26ProRequest\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Successful Response\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/ImageToVideoV26ProOutput\"}}}},\"422\":{\"description\":\"Validation Error\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError\"}}}}}}},\"/create-voice\":{\"post\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"header\",\"schema\":{\"title\":\"X-Fal-Caller-User-Id\",\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"required\":false,\"name\":\"x-fal-caller-user-id\"}],\"summary\":\"Create Voice\",\"description\":\"Create a custom voice from an audio file.\\n\\nUpload an audio file to create a custom voice that can be used\\nwith the voice control feature in V2.6 video generation.\\nThe audio should be clean, noise-free, with a single voice,\\nand duration between 5-30 seconds.\",\"operationId\":\"create_voice_create_voice_post\",\"requestBody\":{\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/CreateVoiceInput\"}}},\"required\":true},\"responses\":{\"200\":{\"description\":\"Successful Response\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/CreateVoiceOutput\"}}}},\"422\":{\"description\":\"Validation Error\",\"content\":{\"application/json\":{\"schema\":{\"$ref\":\"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError\"}}}}}}},\"/effects\":{\"post\":{\"parameters\":[{\"in\":\"header\",\"schema\":{\"title\":\"X-Fal-Caller-User-Id\",\"an